# Content-Security-Policy — path-scoped. Charts is served from /charts on www.ag-grid.com
# and inherits the grid root CSP, so this block overrides it for charts pages (see
# getCspHtaccessBlock). Ordinary pages get the tightened policy (no 'unsafe-eval'); the
# <If> override re-allows it for example-runner documents. The trial-form origin is
# env-split, so the policy is generated per environment.
# Override the CSP inherited from the grid root for /charts pages.
Header always unset Content-Security-Policy
Header always unset Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only
Header always set Content-Security-Policy "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://*.ag-grid.com https://plausible.io https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://js.zi-scripts.com https://*.zoominfo.com https://www.google.com https://www.gstatic.com https://www.youtube.com https://cdn.cookielaw.org blob: 'unsafe-inline' 'wasm-unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-eval'; style-src 'self' https://fonts.googleapis.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https:; connect-src 'self' data: https://*.ag-grid.com https://plausible.io https://*.algolia.net https://*.algolianet.com https://*.google-analytics.com https://*.analytics.google.com https://stats.g.doubleclick.net https://www.googletagmanager.com https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://js.zi-scripts.com https://*.zoominfo.com https://www.google.com https://cdn.cookielaw.org https://*.onetrust.com https://us-central1-aggrid-ecommerce.cloudfunctions.net; frame-src 'self' data: https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.youtube.com https://www.google.com; media-src 'self' data: blob: https:; worker-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self' https://us-central1-aggrid-ecommerce.cloudfunctions.net https://webto.salesforce.com https://codesandbox.io https://plnkr.co; frame-ancestors 'self' https://*.ag-grid.com"

